   "items": [
    "One framed, checksummed, fsynced append opens the payment",
    "The decision is stored before any leg publishes: never re-decided",
    "Reservation keeps in-flight money in a visible pending ledger"
   ],
   "title": "Decide, then publish"
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "items": [
    "One outbox fans three legs carrying the same payment ID",
    "Each destination dedups on that ID: replays are ignored",
    "Fee and settle legs land through the same dedup rule"
   ],
   "title": "Same ID, three legs"
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "items": [
    "A crash after some publishes replays only the missing legs",
    "Final balances converge; readers may see legs land separately",
    "Money is conserved: the checker sums to the funded total"
   ],
   "title": "Crash-safe fan-out"
  }
